# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# Lockfiles — we use bun.lock as the source of truth. package-lock.json is
# generated by `npm install` on deploy hosts (LipeHost) and should NOT be
# committed. Having two lockfiles in the repo causes Next.js 16 to emit
# "multiple lockfiles detected" warnings and can confuse workspace-root
# detection.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

